{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Destroy evidence, leave no trace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've received another job, it pays well but something's not right. Pack up the truck and head to the location - Your task is to <i>clean up</i> the <i>accident</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't leave anything behind, not even your footsteps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Watch your step</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's plenty of Hazards, tread carefully and try not to get yourself killed - Your employer, IPT is closely watching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">13 Levels showcasing a wide variety of mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Electrical System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Deck / Controller Support with Haptics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Leaderboards and Rich Presence</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2924270?t=1740309080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2924270?t=1740309080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924270/2a7cec9c3e5d6ec787217fa1e66d446c7dfea5a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740309080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924270/2a7cec9c3e5d6ec787217fa1e66d446c7dfea5a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740309080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is cartoon blood and unique ways to destroy evidence, including bodies."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Destroy evidence, leave no trace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've received another job, it pays well but something's not right. Pack up the truck an